{"4628680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Outmost Ruminant", "steam_appid": 4628680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A traveler in white attire woke up in an abandoned land, she's one of many on a journey for reasons unknown. With resolve in her heart, she is determined to venture through the abandoned land and face the foes that are standing in her way. As she travels through the ruins, memories not of her own emerge one by one, she gradually uncovers the true reason for her journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a342e0c7befed9299e9241ad4291916c.poster.avif?t=1787574263\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a342e0c7befed9299e9241ad4291916c.webm?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a342e0c7befed9299e9241ad4291916c.mp4?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel through the abandoned land </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a traveler who's on a journey through the abandoned land, the abandoned land is filled with hostile monsters and robots, you'll need to do your best to face the challenges wrought by the entities in the abandoned land.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/7aae8a4ebe83710751790b76855e480d.poster.avif?t=1787574263\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/7aae8a4ebe83710751790b76855e480d.webm?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/7aae8a4ebe83710751790b76855e480d.mp4?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat the robots and monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The traveler will encounter many hostile robots and monsters on her journey, you must use the weapons and resources left behind by the fallen travelers to defeat the enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/6491cc908924999a2f300ef942d5fbd5.poster.avif?t=1787574263\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/6491cc908924999a2f300ef942d5fbd5.webm?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/6491cc908924999a2f300ef942d5fbd5.mp4?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources can be found near the fallen travelers, gather the resources and use them wisely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/4b76562eda09d986f6f67e9edd1b0300.poster.avif?t=1787574263\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/4b76562eda09d986f6f67e9edd1b0300.webm?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/4b76562eda09d986f6f67e9edd1b0300.mp4?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat high rank robots with melee combat and skill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the traveler's journey, she'll encounter high rank robots with special abilities and combat styles, the traveler will use a sword and a shield as her main equipment to fight them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/7dc966d87516cae469014574688c4cfd.poster.avif?t=1787574263\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/7dc966d87516cae469014574688c4cfd.webm?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/7dc966d87516cae469014574688c4cfd.mp4?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traversal between physical realms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between the physical realms, you have to follow the paths shrouded in light to find the entrances to the other realms. Hostile enemies will try to stop you from traversing between realms, you can use projectiles to defeat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a7c8e6239e0ca0ba60e54ed16362d002.poster.avif?t=1787574263\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a7c8e6239e0ca0ba60e54ed16362d002.webm?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a7c8e6239e0ca0ba60e54ed16362d002.mp4?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A traveler in white attire woke up in an abandoned land, she's one of many on a journey for reasons unknown. With resolve in her heart, she is determined to venture through the abandoned land and face the foes that are standing in her way. As she travels through the ruins, memories not of her own emerge one by one, she gradually uncovers the true reason for her journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a342e0c7befed9299e9241ad4291916c.poster.avif?t=1787574263\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a342e0c7befed9299e9241ad4291916c.webm?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/a342e0c7befed9299e9241ad4291916c.mp4?t=1787574263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel through the abandoned land </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a traveler who's on a journey through the abandoned land, the abandoned land is filled with hostile monsters and robots, you'll need to do your best to face the challenges wrought by the entities in the abandoned land.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/7aae8a4ebe83710751790b76855e480d.poster.avif?t=1787574263\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628680/extras/7aae8a4ebe83710751790b7685